  - line: 10
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 11
    type: narration
    text: "And they had barely managed seven days."
  - line: 13
    type: narration
    text: "Patience, came the faint impression through the Prime connection."
  - line: 14
    type: narration
    text: "The Aeon Keepers, offering the only guidance that mattered: Patience, and persistence."
  - line: 15
    type: narration
    text: "Rome wasn't built in a day."
  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "Senareth didn't know what Rome was—the reference existed in knowledge-space they couldn't quite access—but the meaning was clear."
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "Great works took time."
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "Gardens didn't bloom overnight."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "Trust was earned in increments too small to measure until enough accumulated to transform uncertainty into alliance."
  - line: 22
    type: dialogue
    speaker: Senareth
    text: "\"Tomorrow,\""
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "Around them, bioluminescence flickered with anticipation and trepidation in equal measure."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "They had crossed the first threshold."
  - line: 26
    type: narration
    text: "Now came the real work."
  - line: 28
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 30
    type: narration
    text: "To be continued in Part 004: The Convergence"
  - line: 32
    type: narration
    text: "[Running total: ~8,400 words for Part 3]"
  - line: 34
    type: narration
    text: "End of chapter 003"

